uby>享受<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうじゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>権利<rp>(</rp><rt>けんり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はなおさらだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">每个人都有享受自由的权利,而且还有享受生活的权利。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">教授</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きょうじゅ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">教授；教学；授课</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"190473\"><ruby>一人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>教授<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうじゅ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がささやいた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">有一位教授放松了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">興じる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きょうじる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">自得其乐；取乐；寻欢作乐</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">強制</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きょうせい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">强制；强迫；强制执行</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"187669\"><ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にそれをあきらめるように<ruby>強制<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>することができない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">没有什么能强迫我放弃它。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">競争</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きょうそう</span></div><div class