</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">興味</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きょうみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">兴趣；好奇心；热情</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"232171\">あなたは<ruby>花<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>興味<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がありますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你对花有兴趣吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">共鳴</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きょうめい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">共鸣；谐振；共鸣；赞同；同感</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"185912\"><ruby>我々<rp>(</rp><rt>われわれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>共鳴<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>点<rp>(</rp><rt>てん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がおおい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们有点反响。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">教養</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きょうよう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">教养；文化修养；教育水平；素养；修养</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"212349\">その<ruby>医者<rp>(</rp><rt>いしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>教養<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のある<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">医生是个有教育的人。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja